<title>UK: EU sugar import levies.</title>
<headline>EU sugar import levies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>EU sugar representative prices and additional duties on imports effective February 27.</p>
<p>			 Representative price    Additional duty</p>
<p>			 (Ecus per 100 kg net)   (Ecus per 100 kg net)</p>
<p>			   New	 Prev	   New	  Prev</p>
<p> Raw cane sugar     22.88     22.88	  4.86-10.09 4.86-10.09</p>
<p> Raw beet sugar     22.88     22.88	  4.67-9.66  4.67-9.66</p>
<p> Coloured sugar     25.44     26.84	  12.60	11.81</p>
<p> White sugar	  25.44     26.84	  7.99	 7.29</p>
<p> Other syrups	  0.25	0.27	  0.40	 0.38</p>
</text>
